          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 668011704}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1868826426}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa ikasyam na  antas ng ating paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere, Panahon
            na upang pagnilayan ang katapangan, kabutihan, at katotohanang iniwan
            ng mga tauhan sa ating puso.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1486509658}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2014436477}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 668011704}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1868826426}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 076150b8389cf534d9504d08ee06f2ff, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Sa kabila ng kanyang pag-ibig kay Ibarra, pinili ni Maria Clara na
            ipagkatiwala ang kanyang buhay sa Diyos bilang madre. Sa eksenang ito,
            nagbubukas ang nobela sa tema ng kababaihang walang kalayaan at ang epekto
            ng panlipunang presyon.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1868826426}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 7b2372f8dee69c84eb71a3f69445d3de, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Elias at Ibarra ay tumakas sa pamamagitan ng bangka habang hinahabol
            ng Civil Guards. Sa pamamagitan ng kanyang kabayanihan, isinakripisyo
            ni Elias ang kanyang kaligtasan upang mailigtas si Ibarra.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1868826426}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 158b2c978d9099446a04cc8c5bf462bf, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Si Ibarra at Maria Clara ay nagpaalam nang may kapatawaran at pagmamahal.
            Ipinapakita nito ang tema ng pagtanggap, pag-unawa, at pagpipigil sa
            sarili para sa tama.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1486509658}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2014436477}
          direction: 0
